doc_ref = "docs/design/characters.md §Recurring named NPCs: 'Old Tomkin, the juggler, who has thrown the same five clubs for 300 years and dreams, quietly, of finally dropping one.'"
notes = "SUIT AND RANK ARE TBD: the Troupe bullets give neither, and characters.md §The Minors distributes suit-cultures across regions rather than assigning them, so guessing one here would be inventing canon. Home region is the Troupe's own - the bullets sit under 'The Troupe - the Prestige's performers'. Anchors TBD, as Flick's are."
